    "detailed_description": "Multiplayer sandbox where you became a real mechanic. Build everything from the scratch. Make a simple construction or join wheels and engines to build a car then ride it. Build a rocket and fly. Construct a tank to defend yourself.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCREATE<br />\r\nCreate anything form scrap just your imagination could invent. Use simple blocs or complex physics simulation. Stand on the pass of engineer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBETTER TOGETHER<br />\r\nCreate or join any server. Defend your base or capture another one. Communicate through the chat or use signs.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBEYOND PLATFORM<br />\r\nUnique save system let you generate many worlds and share them with friends or your mobile device. Just send a save file and continue creating. Blueprints will help you to save or load any construction on the go.",
